  {
   "id": "s03",
   "text": "n8n is a workflow automation tool. A workflow is a chain of nodes. A trigger node starts it, the other nodes each do one job, and the output of one node becomes the input of the next. That is the whole idea.",
   "visual": [
    {
     "type": "hookcard",
     "theme": "studio",
     "text": "What n8n actually is",
     "accent": [
      "is"
