   "id": "s07",
   "text": "You can use n8n Cloud, which has a free trial that, at the time of recording, needs no credit card. Or you can self-host the Community Edition, which n8n describes as free and running without a license key. For your first build, cloud is faster, so open your dashboard and click Create Workflow.",
