  {
   "id": "s41",
   "text": "Pick one boring task you repeat every week. Write it as a sentence: when this happens, do that. The first half is your trigger and the second half is your agent and tools. If you can say it as one sentence, you can almost certainly build it as a workflow. Start there, and keep it small.",
